// AgentDocumentBody is the raw Client ID Metadata Document JSON served for
// the demo agent identifier. It authorizes the authorization_code (with
// token exchange for delegation) and client_credentials (the actor token)
// grants, pins the query.jwt JARM response mode on the redirect URI, and
// authorizes the example resource server to introspect the client's tokens
// (RFC 7662 section 2.1 authorized_introspection_clients). The
// pairwise subject type keeps the D-12/D-12.1 privacy posture for the
